        <mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;Alerts: the profile’s &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:ui-monospace,SF Mono,Cascadia Mono,Consolas,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;[live]&lt;/span&gt; section names the detectors (error spike, silence, crash, slow outlier, rate change, memory growth) and rules; silence after 60 s, cooldown 5 minutes. Desktop notices only while the window is not seen: at most one a kind every 30 s and five every 5 minutes.&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,system-ui,sans-serif;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#14171C,#ECEEF1);rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#C4C7CD,#353A42);fillColor=light-dark(#F0F2F5,#1B1E23);align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="768" y="424" width="528" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
